<title>TUNISIA: TUNIS BOURSE INDEX CLOSES UP IN THIN TRADE.</title>
<headline>TUNIS BOURSE INDEX CLOSES UP IN THIN TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Thursday closed up by 0.5 percent in thin trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The 31-share index closed at 477.76 from 475.38 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Volume was 530,864 dinars against 786,415 dinars.</p>
<p>Banque de l'Habitat was up 0.53 dinar to 17.69 dinars. Chemical firm Al-Kimia gained 0.5 dinar to 44 dinars. Airliner Tunis Air won 0.5 dinar to 18 dinars. ($= 1.06 dinars)</p>
</text>
